  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>One creature you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the &amp;Reference[charmed apply=false]{Charmed} condition for the duration. A creature that isn’t a Humanoid succeeds automatically.</p><p>A spectral crown appears on the Charmed target’s head. On each of its turns, before moving, it must use its action to make a melee attack against a creature other than itself that you mentally choose; it can act normally on its turn if you choose no creature or if none is within its reach. The target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.</p><p>On your later turns, you must take the Magic action to keep control of the target, or the spell ends.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
